# Redis Configuration for Production Caching
# 
# Option 1: Upstash Redis (Recommended for Vercel)
# Sign up at https://upstash.com/ and create a Redis database
# Copy the REST API credentials from the Upstash console
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://your-redis-url.upstash.io
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=your-redis-token-here

# Option 2: Generic Redis (for self-hosted or other providers)
# REDIS_URL=redis://your-redis-host:6379
# REDIS_TOKEN=your-redis-password

# Note: If neither UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL nor REDIS_URL is set,
# the application will fall back to in-memory caching

